This is a multi-wiki template used on both the Kicksecure and {{project_name_short}} wikis. Keep both copies identical to avoid drift.

Parameters:
* <code>config</code> -- the <code>example-configs/</code> file to include (for example <code>example-configs/kicksecure.yml</code> or <code>example-configs/qubes-os-r4.3.yml</code>).
* <code>template1</code> -- the template to build (for example <code>kicksecure-18</code>).
* <code>template2</code> -- optional second template to build (for example a gateway plus a workstation).

Example:

<pre>
{{Build_Documentation_Qubes_Template
|config=example-configs/qubes-os-r4.3.yml
|template1=whonix-gateway-18
|template2=whonix-workstation-18
}}
</pre>
